        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 4a6b40ed-5055-4709-aca2-9bbec9bce16b).Image",
        "Description": "This contract is pretty straightforward. Our client has been the victim of a smear campaign by two journalists working for GNN. This campaign lead to the downfall of the clients political career. Note that our client wants noone else harmed so the contract will be void should you fail to comply this request.\r\rA bonus will be issued should you be able to make it look like an accident and a second bonus if you dont leave any evidence behind.",
